'''Super Metal Hippoe''' (超メタルカバちゃん, ''Chō Metaru Kaba-chan'', '''Super Metal Hippo-chan''') is a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] variant of [[Metal Hippoe]] that appears in [[The Aku Realms]] and [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.5 Update|Version 2.0.5]].

