==Trivia==
*He was originally exclusive to [[Super Metal Hippoe (Expert)|Siege of Hippoe!]], making him the first event enemy to become a regular enemy.
*A Trojan virus is malware that makes its way onto victims' computers by disguising itself as a real program.
*In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], Super Metal Hippoe's description says he came down with a [[Doge]] virus.
*Super Metal Hippoe, [[Firecracker]] and [[Metafilibuster (Enemy)|Metafilibuster]] are the only enemy units whose knockback animations have multiple frames.
**[[Dark Emperor Nyandam]], [[Director Kurosawah]], [[Skelecat (Enemy)|Skelecat]], [[Gato Amigo (Enemy)|Gato Amigo]], [[Manic Lion Cat (Enemy)|Manic Lion Cat]] and [[The 9th Angel (Enemy)|The 9th Angel]] are all internally set to have knockback animations that last more than 1 frame, however they still remain static when knocked back.

